      ],
      "orig": "The comment period for the proposed regulation ended on August 18, 2026. Consideration of input received resulted in modification to the originally proposed text in the paragraph of subsection 672.1(c)(1) to clarify who may conduct inspections of conveyances, and is provided with this notice in accordance with Government Code section 11346.8(c) and Title 1, Section 44 CCR.",
      "text": "The comment period for the proposed regulation ended on August 18, 2026. Consideration of input received resulted in modification to the originally proposed text in the paragraph of subsection 672.1(c)(1) to clarify who may conduct inspections of conveyances, and is provided with this notice in accordance with Government Code section 11346.8(c) and Title 1, Section 44 CCR."
    },
